# ============================================================================
# 1. AUTENTICACIÓN Y USUARIOS (200, 201, 400, 401, 403, 409)
# ============================================================================

### 1.1 Login exitoso como Administrador → 200 OK
POST {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "admin@itq.ec",
  "password": "Admin12345"
}

### 1.2 Login con credenciales incorrectas → 401 Unauthorized
POST {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "admin@itq.ec",
  "password": "clave-incorrecta"
}

### 1.3 Consultar perfil propio con token válido → 200 OK
GET {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/auth/yo
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### 1.4 Consultar usuarios SIN token → 401 Unauthorized
GET {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/usuarios

### 1.5 Consultar usuarios con rol Mesero (no es Admin) → 403 Forbidden
GET {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMesero}}

### 1.6 Registrar usuario Cocina (como Admin) → 201 Created
POST {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Carlos Cocina",
  "correo": "cocina@itq.ec",
  "password": "Cocina12345",
  "rol": "Cocina"
}

### 1.7 Registrar usuario Mesero (como Admin) → 201 Created
POST {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "María Mesera",
  "correo": "mesero@itq.ec",
  "password": "Mesero12345",
  "rol": "Mesero"
}

### 1.8 Registrar usuario con correo repetido → 409 Conflict
POST {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Otro Mesero",
  "correo": "mesero@itq.ec",
  "password": "Mesero12345",
  "rol": "Mesero"
}

### 1.9 Registrar usuario con contraseña corta (< 8 chars) → 400 Bad Request
POST {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Usuario Invalido",
  "correo": "invalido@itq.ec",
  "password": "123",
  "rol": "Mesero"
}


# ============================================================================
# 2. PLATOS Y CATEGORÍAS (200, 201, 204, 400, 401, 403, 404, 409)
# ============================================================================

### 2.1 Obtener todos los platos (Público) → 200 OK
GET {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/platos
Accept: application/json

### 2.2 Buscar un plato que NO existe → 404 Not Found
GET {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/platos/999
Accept: application/json

### 2.3 Crear plato con precio inválido (<= 0) → 400 Bad Request
POST {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/platos
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Plato Gratis",
  "descripcion": "Precio inválido",
  "precio": 0,
  "disponible": true,
  "categoriaId": 1
}

### 2.4 Actualizar plato con IDs distintos → 400 Bad Request
PUT {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/platos/4
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 9,
  "nombre": "Prueba de error",
  "descripcion": "Esto debe fallar",
  "precio": 5.00,
  "disponible": true,
  "categoriaId": 1
}

### 2.5 Eliminar un plato exitosamente (borrado lógico) → 204 No Content
DELETE {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/platos/6
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### 2.6 Eliminar categoría que tiene platos asociados → 409 Conflict
DELETE {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/categorias/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}


# ============================================================================
# 3. MESAS Y CÓDIGO QR (200, 201, 204, 400, 404, 409)
# ============================================================================

### 3.1 Listar mesas (SoloAdmin) → 200 OK
GET {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/mesas
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### 3.2 Crear mesa nueva → 201 Created
POST {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/mesas
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numero": 10,
  "capacidad": 4
}

### 3.3 Crear mesa con número repetido → 409 Conflict
POST {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/mesas
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numero": 10,
  "capacidad": 4
}

### 3.4 Crear mesa con capacidad inválida (> 20) → 400 Bad Request
POST {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/mesas
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numero": 11,
  "capacidad": 50
}

### 3.5 Descargar código QR PNG de la mesa 1 → 200 OK (image/png)
GET {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/mesas/1/qr
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}


# ============================================================================
# 4. RECORRIDO COMPLETO DE UN PEDIDO (201 → Pendiente → EnPreparacion → Listo → Entregado)
# ============================================================================

### 4.1 Crear pedido (toma el precio desde la BD) → 201 Created (Estado: Pendiente)
POST {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/pedidos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mesaId": 1,
  "items": [
    { "platoId": 1, "cantidad": 2 },
    { "platoId": 2, "cantidad": 1 }
  ]
}

### 4.2 Crear pedido vacío (sin items) → 400 Bad Request
POST {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/pedidos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mesaId": 1,
  "items": []
}

### 4.3 Crear pedido con plato inexistente → 404 Not Found
POST {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/pedidos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mesaId": 1,
  "items": [
    { "platoId": 999, "cantidad": 1 }
  ]
}

### 4.4 Intentar avanzar de Pendiente a EnPreparacion con rol Mesero → 403 Forbidden (Solo Cocina puede)
PATCH {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/pedidos/1/avanzar
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMesero}}

### 4.5 Paso 1 del recorrido: Cocina avanza de Pendiente → EnPreparacion → 200 OK
PATCH {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/pedidos/1/avanzar
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCocina}}

### 4.6 Paso 2 del recorrido: Cocina avanza de EnPreparacion → Listo → 200 OK
PATCH {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/pedidos/1/avanzar
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCocina}}

### 4.7 Intentar avanzar de Listo a Entregado con rol Cocina → 403 Forbidden (Solo Mesero puede)
PATCH {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/pedidos/1/avanzar
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCocina}}

### 4.8 Paso 3 del recorrido: Mesero avanza de Listo → Entregado → 200 OK
PATCH {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/pedidos/1/avanzar
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMesero}}

### 4.9 Intentar avanzar un pedido que ya está Entregado → 409 Conflict
PATCH {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/pedidos/1/avanzar
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMesero}}

### 4.10 Consultar el pedido finalizado → 200 OK
GET {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/pedidos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMesero}}
